""SELECT s1.\"ServiceRecordID\", s1.\"BookingID\", s1.\"CustomerID\", s1.\"IsDeleted\", s1.\"MechanicId\", s1.\"ServiceID\", s1.\"Status\", s1.\"CustomerID0\", s1.\"Email\", s1.\"Name\", s1.\"Phone\", s1.\"Status0\", s1.\"MechanicId0\", s1.\"Email0\", s1.\"Name0\", s1.\"Phone0\", s1.\"Status1\", s0.\"ServiceID\", s0.\"Description\", s0.\"IsDeleted\", s0.\"VehicleID\", v.\"VehicleID\", s4.\"ServiceCategoriesCategoryID\", s4.\"ServicesServiceID\", s4.\"CategoryID\", s4.\"Amount\", s4.\"Name\", s4.\"Status\", v.\"IsDeleted\", v.\"VechicleManufacturer\", v.\"VehicleModel\", v.\"VehicleNo\", v.\"VehicleType\"
FROM (
    SELECT s.\"ServiceRecordID\", s.\"BookingID\", s.\"CustomerID\", s.\"IsDeleted\", s.\"MechanicId\", s.\"ServiceID\", s.\"Status\", c.\"CustomerID\" AS \"CustomerID0\", c.\"Email\", c.\"Name\", c.\"Phone\", c.\"Status\" AS \"Status0\", m.\"MechanicId\" AS \"MechanicId0\", m.\"Email\" AS \"Email0\", m.\"Name\" AS \"Name0\", m.\"Phone\" AS \"Phone0\", m.\"Status\" AS \"Status1\"
    FROM \"serviceRecords\" AS s
    INNER JOIN \"Customers\" AS c ON s.\"CustomerID\" = c.\"CustomerID\"
    INNER JOIN \"Mechanics\" AS m ON s.\"MechanicId\" = m.\"MechanicId\"
    WHERE NOT (s.\"IsDeleted\") AND (c.\"Phone\" LIKE @__search_0_contains OR m.\"Phone\" LIKE @__search_0_contains)
    LIMIT @__p_2 OFFSET @__p_1
) AS s1
INNER JOIN \"Services\" AS s0 ON s1.\"ServiceID\" = s0.\"ServiceID\"
INNER JOIN \"Vehicles\" AS v ON s0.\"VehicleID\" = v.\"VehicleID\"
LEFT JOIN (
    SELECT s2.\"ServiceCategoriesCategoryID\", s2.\"ServicesServiceID\", s3.\"CategoryID\", s3.\"Amount\", s3.\"Name\", s3.\"Status\"
    FROM \"ServiceServiceCategory\" AS s2
    INNER JOIN \"ServiceCategories\" AS s3 ON s2.\"ServiceCategoriesCategoryID\" = s3.\"CategoryID\"
) AS s4 ON s0.\"ServiceID\" = s4.\"ServicesServiceID\"
